{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"f9bf1ed99dbfd44a0caf2fc713e26c0e171bacf943303077c0d5016eb0203a8d","url":"http://www.bing.com/news/apiclick.aspx?ref=FexRss&aid=&tid=6a9d49509aa34921bbed3b41024088d5&url=https%3a%2f%2ffinance.yahoo.com%2fnews%2finvitation-presentation-skanskas-end-report-111400384.html&c=6638974560758048808&mkt=en-us","title":"Invitation to the presentation of Skanska's Year-end report 2025 on February 6","author":null,"publishedAt":null,"retrievedAt":"2026-09-06T11:07:57.927Z","text":"STOCKHOLM, Jan. 30, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Skanska's Year-end report 2025 will be released on Friday February 6 at 07:30 am CET.          The report will be presented by Anders Danielsson, Skanska's President and CEO, and Pontus Winqvist, CFO, at a webcasted press- and audio conference at 10:00 am CET at Skanska's head office at Warfvinges väg 25 in Stockholm. The presentation will be broadcast live at www.group.skanska.com/investors, where it also will be posted shortly afterwards.              Participate in the audio conference, with the possibility to ask questions:            Preferred connection (web link): For best audio quality, please join the call from your phone via the HD Audio web link here: HD Audio link         Backup connection (phone number): If you need to call in via a telephone line use these numbers:          +46 (0)8 5051 0031         +44 (0) 207 107 06 13         +1 (1) 631 570 56 13              After the conference, there will be possibilities for individual meetings with Anders Danielsson. To apply for a meeting please contact annika.winlund@skanska.se no later than February 4.          Welcome!          Antonia Junelind, SVP, Investor Relations          Karolina Cederhage, SVP, Communications          For further information please contact:          Antonia Junelind, Senior Vice President Investor Relations, Skanska AB, tel +46 (0)10 448 62 61          Karolina Cederhage, Senior Vice President Communications, Skanska AB, tel +46 (0)10 448 08 80          Jacob Birkeland, Head of Media Relations and Public Affairs, Skanska AB, tel +46 (0)10 449 19 57              Direct line for media, tel +46 (0)10 448 88 99          This and previous releases can also be found at www.skanska.com.          This information was brought to you by Cision http://news.cision.com          https://news.cision.com/skanska/r/invitation-to-the-presentation-of-skanska-s-year-end-report-2025-on-february-6,c4300012          The following files are available for download:           Cision            View original content:https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/invitation-to-the-presentation-of-skanskas-year-end-report-2025-on-february-6-302675000.html","hash":"84dc2817af656e62c28b28d1472615a05df516daee8d881e5cbc6e63d8205924","family":"bing.com","sourceClass":"unclassified","attribution":"unknown","visibility":"public","extractionCoverage":"unattempted","completeness":"full","access":"retrieved","acquisition":"html-reader","outboundUrls":["https://finance.yahoo.com/news/invitation-presentation-skanskas-end-report-111400384.html#navigation-container","https://finance.yahoo.com/news/invitation-presentation-skanskas-end-report-111400384.html#nimbus-app","https://finance.yahoo.com/news/invitation-presentation-skanskas-end-report-111400384.html#right-rail","https://finance.yahoo.com/","https://www.yahoo.com/","https://sports.yahoo.com/","https://www.yahoo.com/news/","https://www.yahoo.com/news/us/","https://www.yahoo.com/news/politics/","https://www.yahoo.com/news/world/","https://weather.yahoo.com/","https://tech.yahoo.com/","https://www.yahoo.com/news/science/","https://www.yahoo.com/guides/originals/","https://www.yahoo.com/newsletters/","https://www.yahoo.com/games","https://www.yahoo.com/lifestyle/","https://health.yahoo.com/","https://www.yahoo.com/lifestyle/family-relationships/","https://www.yahoo.com/lifestyle/horoscope/","https://shopping.yahoo.com/","https://www.yahoo.com/lifestyle/food-drink/","https://travel.yahoo.com/","https://autos.ya